# @name listarCartItems
GET {{host}}//cart
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

###
POST {{host}}/cart/add
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 1
}

